00:00:02,127 --> 00:00:04,507
Let's see, Raj was the kung pao chicken.

2
00:00:04,671 --> 00:00:07,551
- I'm the dumplings.
- Yes, you are.

3
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:10,430
(Penny:)Creepy, Howard.

4
00:00:10,593 --> 00:00:12,093
(Howard:)Creepy good or creepy bad?

5
00:00:13,471 --> 00:00:16,181
- Who was the shrimp with lobster sauce?
- That would be me.

6
00:00:16,349 --> 00:00:19,889
Come to Papa, you un-kosher delight.

7
00:00:20,645 --> 00:00:23,105
(Howard:)I'm not necessarily talking to the food.

8
00:00:28,611 --> 00:00:30,241
(Penny:)Sit over there.

9
00:00:34,993 --> 00:00:36,743
(Penny:)Sit over there.

10
00:00:46,129 --> 00:00:48,419
(Sheldon(entering, to Penny who is in his spot):)- Baby wipe?
- Why do you have...?

11
00:00:48,590 --> 00:00:50,470
- No, don't ask.
- No, don't, don't.

12
00:00:51,634 --> 00:00:52,674
(Sheldon:)I'll tell you why.

13
00:00:52,844 --> 00:00:53,974
[BOTH SIGH]

14
00:00:54,137 --> 00:00:56,637
(Sheldon:)I had to sanitize my hands
because the university...

15
00:00:56,806 --> 00:00:59,936
